sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Gateway as Command Gateway
    participant Identity as Identity Domain
    participant Policy as Policy Domain
    participant Risk as Risk Domain
    participant Budget as Budget Governance
    participant Approval as Approval Domain
    participant Runtime as Durable Runtime
    participant Domain as Owning Domain
    participant Integration as Integration Domain
    participant Events as Enterprise Events
    participant Audit as Audit Domain

    Caller->>Gateway: Submit versioned command
    Gateway->>Identity: Authenticate actor or workload
    Identity-->>Gateway: Identity evidence
    Gateway->>Policy: Evaluate intent and scope
    Policy-->>Gateway: Policy decision
    Gateway->>Risk: Assess material risk
    Risk-->>Gateway: Risk assessment
    opt Financial or exposure impact
        Gateway->>Budget: Authorize consumption
        Budget-->>Gateway: Budget decision
    end
    opt Human-exclusive decision required
        Gateway->>Approval: Request bound approval
        Approval-->>Gateway: Authenticated decision
    end
    Gateway->>Runtime: Create durable execution
    Runtime->>Domain: Dispatch idempotent domain command
    Domain-->>Runtime: State transition and result
    opt External side effect required
        Runtime->>Integration: Execute governed provider operation
        Integration-->>Runtime: Reconciled provider result
    end
    Domain->>Events: Publish canonical event through outbox
    Runtime->>Audit: Append correlated execution evidence
    Runtime-->>Gateway: Terminal or waiting status
    Gateway-->>Caller: Accepted result and execution reference
